## Frontend

- Meet WCAG 2.2 AA: semantic HTML, keyboard access, visible focus, text alternatives and sufficient contrast.
- Every view that loads data handles its loading, empty and error states.
- Anything shipped to the browser or app is public: no secrets, private keys or internal URLs in client code.
- Use the existing components and design tokens before adding new ones.
- Validate forms in the client for a better experience, but rely on the server's validation.
